          Type: (string) (len=9) "paragraph",
          Value: (string) (len=413) "Matryoshka dolls (/ ˌ m æ t r i ˈ ɒ ʃ k ə / MAT -ree- OSH -kə; Russian: матрёшка, IPA:), also known as stacking dolls, nesting dolls, Russian tea dolls, or Russian dolls, are a set of wooden dolls of decreasing size placed one inside another. The name Matryoshka, is a diminutive form of Matryosha (Матрёша), in turn a hypocoristic of the Russian female first name Matryona (Матрёна).",
